{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic這場萬眾矚目的IPO，反倒引燃了人工智能板塊的猛烈拋售潮。受Anthropic盤後走弱拖累，晶片股大幅下挫，各大核心科技指數觸及熊市關口。台灣加權指數周五收跌6.2%，創下1991年以來最差單周表現；韓國綜合指數本周累計跌幅有望達到8%；日經225指數回落至今年4月水平。<br/></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587276.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:01.978161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:04:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:17.071320+00:00","content_hash":"bb4f6896dd458e33d8085fe705d8cfa564104c070c77a2ed32b6bc47dad06677","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}